rgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/commits/894dae154c5fd28318f9e6a28a48abe049aa2d52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-01T21:33:34Z","email":"d.collazzi@gmail.com","name":"Dante"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-01T21:33:34Z","email":"d.collazzi@gmail.com","name":"Dante"},"message":"Add stadium decorations around the field\n\nNew decorative elements:\n1. GRANDSTANDS (Gradas):\n   - Two covered stands on long sides of the field\n   - 8 rows of stepped concrete seating\n   - Colorful seats (blue, red, yellow randomly)\n   - Covered roof with supporting pillars\n\n2. LIGHT TOWERS:\n   - 4 tall floodlight towers at corners\n   - 20m high poles with platforms\n   - 4 illuminated light boxes per tower\n   - Emissive material for glow effect\n\n3. TEAM BENCHES:\n   - Two covered dugouts (one per team)\n   - Team-colored roofs (blue/red)\n   - Positioned at midfield sideline\n\n4. CORNER FLAGS:\n   - White poles at all 4 corners\n   - Orange triangular flags\n   - Proper field corner positioning\n\n5. ADVERTISING BOARDS:\n   - LED-style boards around the pitch\n   - Colorful segmented design\n   - Placed along all four sides","tree":{"sha":"033d3cfdc8a3325e7087b5cbdd56c11e20b6a858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/git/trees/033d3cfdc8a3325e7087b5cbdd56c11e20b6a858"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/git/commits/894dae154c5fd28318f9e6a28a48abe049aa2d52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"ava