,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/commits/662436be50086e2295dde17e2fb318516c4a8051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-01T21:23:40Z","email":"d.collazzi@gmail.com","name":"Dante"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-01T21:23:40Z","email":"d.collazzi@gmail.com","name":"Dante"},"message":"Improve mobile controls with better UX\n\nMobileJoystick improvements:\n- Move joystick to bottom-left corner (more ergonomic)\n- Add large KICK button on bottom-right corner\n- Adaptive sizing based on screen dimensions\n- Visual charge indicator showing kick power (0-3s)\n- Color-coded kick button (green → yellow → red)\n- Circular progress ring around kick button during charge\n- Direction arrows on joystick for better guidance\n- Improved visual feedback with gradients and shadows\n- Labels showing ''MOVE'' and ''HOLD TO CHARGE'' hints\n- Responsive design for different screen sizes\n\nGame.js adjustments:\n- Remove wrapper div that was constraining joystick position\n- Move mobile chat to top-right to avoid control conflicts\n- Higher z-index for controls to ensure visibility","tree":{"sha":"2a48ef35ad76880cb08d6c990dd5043b2a7d8927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/git/trees/2a48ef35ad76880cb08d6c990dd5043b2a7d8927"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/git/commits/662436be50086e2295dde17e2fb318516c4a8051","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6526251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http