\nFixes:\n- Create proper particle texture with radial gradient (visible white dots)\n- Remove lighting changes that were affecting character colors\n- Lower particle emitter height (25 units) so particles are visible\n- Increase particle sizes for better visibility\n- Rain: elongated particles (scaleY 2-4x) falling fast\n- Snow: larger flakes (0.15-0.4) with slow floating motion\n- Keep only fog effect for atmosphere, no lighting modifications\n- Add console logs for debugging weather changes","tree":{"sha":"a813827d8978f5f5d113622805bc06fd6ef75583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/git/trees/a813827d8978f5f5d113622805bc06fd6ef75583"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/git/commits/64a1238a0cbfc63b1dee5cd71a58a8d2f68682b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6526251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PitiGo","id":6526251,"login":"PitiGo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjYyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PitiGo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PitiGo/Mammals-vs-Reptiles/commit/64a1238a0cbfc63b1dee5cd71a58a8d2f68682b7","node_id":"C_kwDONSTCBdoAKDY0YTEyMzhhMGNiZmM2M2IxZGVlNWNkNzFhNThhOGQyZjY4Njgy