":"aeb87d3684f68fe58ef4adaf74d48afd43046cee"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"cocampo1005","providerType":"User"},"email":"cocampo1005@yahoo.com","name":"Christian Ocampo"},"authoredDate":"2025-08-28T14:32:22Z","committedDate":"2025-08-28T14:32:22Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"cocampo1005","providerType":"User"},"email":"cocampo1005@yahoo.com","name":"Christian Ocampo"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:36:03.547Z","repositoryId":891799336,"sha":"15fcdbd2f7bed0cb34992f7bbb9146e2a6831233"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"juansrodz","providerType":"User"},"email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"Sebastian Rodriguez"},"authoredDate":"2025-08-27T20:28:38Z","committedDate":"2025-08-27T20:28:38Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:36:03.547Z","repositoryId":891799336,"sha":"7b3d7f5f726bd42af5bf028b56b4f017cc7d5da2"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"cocampo1005","providerType":"User"},"email":"36025112+cocampo1005@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Christian Ocampo"},"authoredDate":"2025-08-27T20:27:03Z","committedDate":"2025-08-27T20:27:03Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:36:03.547Z","repositoryId":891799336,"sha":"aa967bd7c7243fa10dc5e047103638d9d6220a64"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:36:03.547Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commits/324b6fff0a08b8ec7e5dd73ee093fad70bfe2a05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:38:40Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:38:40Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"fix(router): send a visitor who signs out to /login instead of crashing the page\n\nThe TanStack Router migration replaced the old reactive guard (a component\nthat rendered <Navigate to=\"/login\"> the moment the context lost its user)\nwith a `beforeLoad` check that only runs on navigation. Signing out from\nany signed-in page therefore re-rendered that page with a null user; the\nprofile page crashed on `currentUser.email` and the router showed its error\nboundary instead of the login form.\n\n`SignedInLayout` now wraps the signed-in layout: when both the context and\nFirebase report no user it renders nothing and navigates to /login with the\ncurrent public href as the redirect, reading the location through a ref so\nthe pending navigation cannot retrigger the effect. `auth.currentUser` still\ncounts as signed in, because right after a sign-in the context is loading\nthe profile document while Firebase already knows the user.\n\nThe new test signs a user out on the events page through mutable stand-ins\nfor Firebase and the auth context, and the events stub reads `currentUser.uid`\nso rendering it signed out would throw; the two existing router tests gain\nthe same auth-context stand-in.","tree":{"sha":"c04cdddce0781c0b2336a5c95a69221d7ebf6c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/git/trees/c04cdddce0781c0b2336a5c95a69221d7ebf6c3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/git/commits/324b6fff0a08b8ec7e5dd73ee093fad70bfe2a05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commit/324b6fff0a08b8ec7e5dd73ee093fad70bfe2a05","node_id":"C_kwDONSfHKNoAKDMyNGI2ZmZmMGEwOGI4ZWM3ZTVkZDczZWUwOTNmYWQ3MGJmZTJhMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commit/328c5d3de5d7b35b83277af1bda3919693d9786b","sha":"328c5d3de5d7b35b83277af1bda3919693d9786b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commits/328c5d3de5d7b35b83277af1bda3919693d9786b"}],"sha":"324b6fff0a08b8ec7e5dd73ee093fad70bfe2a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commits/324b6fff0a08b8ec7e5dd73ee093fad70bfe2a05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commits/328c5d3de5d7b35b83277af1bda3919693d9786b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:38:24Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:38:24Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"feat(embed): mount the app in a stable-height frame that pins fixed elements\n\nUnder a host basepath, App.jsx now wraps the app in a frame of stable height\n(80dvh, at least 560px) with an inner scrolling element. The frame carries a\ntransform, which makes it the containing block for every `position: fixed`\ndescendant: the sidebar, the page header, the mobile tab bar, the \"+\" buttons\nand every dialog pin to the frame instead of the browser viewport, and the app\nscrolls inside it like a window. `src/index.css` remaps `h-screen` and\n`min-h-screen` under `.wbw-embedded` to the frame''s height, so the login\npage, the loader and the sidebar fill the frame rather than 100vh.\n\nWith that, the per-component class switching from f09623e is unnecessary:\nHome, Navbar, Events and EventDetails return to their standalone markup, the\n`useEmbedded` hook and its layout tests go, and nothing in the components\ndiffers between the two modes any more. The wrapper test asserts the frame\nand its scroll element; the README''s federation notes describe the rule.","tree":{"sha":"c00f6d2992745a577ac9ef94cc3b4a82be5a1859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/git/trees/c00f6d2992745a577ac9ef94cc3b4a82be5a1859"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/git/commits/328c5d3de5d7b35b83277af1bda3919693d9786b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commit/328c5d3de5d7b35b83277af1bda3919693d9786b","node_id":"C_kwDONSfHKNoAKDMyOGM1ZDNkZTVkN2IzNWI4MzI3N2FmMWJkYTM5MTk2OTNkOTc4NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commit/f09623e5e69a305ec500a5b2a8cc257f540ebc16","sha":"f09623e5e69a305ec500a5b2a8cc257f540ebc16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commits/f09623e5e69a305ec500a5b2a8cc257f540ebc16"}],"sha":"328c5d3de5d7b35b83277af1bda3919693d9786b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commits/328c5d3de5d7b35b83277af1bda3919693d9786b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commits/f09623e5e69a305ec500a5b2a8cc257f540ebc16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T04:36:10Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T04:36:10Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"fix(layout): keep the signed-in layout inside the host''s box when embedded\n\nStandalone, the desktop sidebar, the page header, the mobile tab bar and the\nmobile \"+\" buttons are pinned to the viewport with `position: fixed`, and the\ncontent is offset to make room. Mounted under the portfolio''s basepath those\nelements escaped the remote''s region and covered the host''s own header.\n\n`useEmbedded()` reads the router''s basepath; when it is not \"/\", the same parts\nflow inside the layout: the sidebar is an in-flow column, the header a normal\nblock, the tab bar the last row of the region, and the \"+\" buttons anchor to\nthe content column or the event card. Standalone classes are unchanged.\nModals stay fixed on purpose.\n\nTests render the layout under \"/\" and \"/projects/wbw\" and assert where fixed\npositioning is allowed; the hook has its own test. README notes the rule.","tree":{"sha":"2c1980a1d5d51d5a2e44ca5cf6e8fb9dc5e0dc2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/git/trees/2c1980a1d5d51d5a2e44ca5cf6e8fb9dc5e0dc2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/git/commits/f09623e5e69a305ec500a5b2a8cc257f540ebc16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansrodz","id":26170268,"login":"juansrodz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTcwMjY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commit/f09623e5e69a305ec500a5b2a8cc257f540e