ttps://api.github.com/users/juansrodz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/commits/606c9ded5ce0ebc9f204e7082a4694d392a96549/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:50:18Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:50:18Z","email":"juansrodz@gmail.com","name":"juansrodz"},"message":"feat: TanStack Router with a basepath, replacing React Router\n\nSwaps react-router-dom for @tanstack/react-router so the app can be\ncreated with a basepath and run standalone at \"/\" or as a federated\nremote under \"/projects/wbw\". createAppRouter({ basepath, history })\nbuilds the route tree; App({ basename }) wires it up. All in-app\n`to=\"/...\"` links stay root-relative; the router prefixes them with\nthe basepath. The signed-in guard captures the full public href\n(basepath included) as the login redirect target, which Login/Signup\nnavigate back to via `navigate({ href })`.\n\nThe /users route and its RequireChef guard from the brief this was\nbuilt from are not included: neither src/components/RequireChef.jsx\nnor src/pages/Users/index.jsx exist at this branch''s base commit —\nthat work lives only on the unmerged feature-user-page branch. See\ntask-2-report.md for details.","tree":{"sha":"b88e476e4a5b0048c802eea7e8a5a48a02ee10b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/git/trees/b88e476e4a5b0048c802eea7e8a5a48a02ee10b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cocampo1005/whosbringingwhat/git/commits/606c9ded5ce0ebc9f204e7082a4694d392a96549","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26170268?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansrodz/foll