committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:31:33Z","email":"albert_haf@hotmail.com","name":"AlbertBCN33"},"message":"feat: continuous deployment to Firebase Hosting, one site per app\n\n- firebase.json: a Hosting site per app with SPA fallback, CORS on the\n  remotes, immutable caching only for hashed JS/CSS, security headers\n- .firebaserc is the single source of truth for site IDs; the production\n  federation.manifest.json is written from it into the built shell at\n  deploy time (no rebuild)\n- Nx deploy target per app (pinned firebase-tools via npx)\n- CI deploy job: runs only after CI passes on main, deploys the affected\n  apps (remotes before the shell), never cancels mid-deploy, then checks\n  the live sites (verify-deploy: CORS, caching, manifest, SPA fallback);\n  opt-in via the DEPLOY_ENABLED repository variable\n- manual \"deploy-all\" run for changes not tied to an app\n- docs/deployment.md (setup, rollback) and ADR 0009\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af853426e67bb5f7b092608a86b7887387729cdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlbertBCN33/micro-frontends/git/trees/af853426e67bb5f7b092608a86b7887387729cdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlbertBCN33/micro-frontends/git/commits/01fca5af03f5a491c40e361c1ef175211250f944","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5541588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlbertBCN33","id":5541588,"login":"AlbertBCN33","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDE1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/orgs","received_events_url":"https:/