l.com","name":"AlbertBCN33"},"message":"test(e2e): each app owns the e2e tests for its own journeys\n\n- market-e2e: catalog filters in the URL, empty and not-found states, API\n  failure with retry, save toggle across catalog and detail, axe\n- wishlist-e2e (new journeys): totals, remove with announcement, clear,\n  links to the market, axe on empty and filled lists\n- shell-e2e keeps only journeys across apps (lazy loading, cross-app\n  state, i18n across apps, a remote going down) and the shell''s own pages;\n  its cross-app journey also audits composed remote pages with axe\n\nRemote suites run against each remote''s standalone production build on a\ndedicated port (4301/4302), so a remote''s team can verify and ship\nwithout the shell. serve-dist accepts app:port; suite URLs are\noverridable per app (E2E_SHELL_URL, E2E_MARKET_URL, E2E_WISHLIST_URL).\ne2e targets run one at a time (parallelism: false).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a950f1df98d93a63e0b717702ee9799ca75fcdef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlbertBCN33/micro-frontends/git/trees/a950f1df98d93a63e0b717702ee9799ca75fcdef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlbertBCN33/micro-frontends/git/commits/b74a59fd40f523edb6b26abb13825d41085a132e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5541588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlbertBCN33","id":5541588,"login":"AlbertBCN33","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDE1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user