gisters each\n  remote from federation.manifest.json on first visit, dedupes\n  concurrent loads and retries after failures\n- a failed or contract-breaking remote renders a contained error page\n- layout ported from the original header/layout: skip link, focus moved\n  to <main> on path changes, aria-current, language switcher, live\n  wishlist badge, responsive two-row header on small screens\n- dashboard shows shared wishlist state and which remotes are loaded\n- documentation section: system design and an accessible SVG diagram\n- main.ts may not import shared packages (lint rule): they only resolve\n  after initFederation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bc32002ae3ac69bbbdc3b3d557e0a6ad3dd2a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlbertBCN33/micro-frontends/git/trees/3bc32002ae3ac69bbbdc3b3d557e0a6ad3dd2a61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlbertBCN33/micro-frontends/git/commits/dba3d31d5c3d5f754e02e7f7f3546a410cb3f631","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5541588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlbertBCN33","id":5541588,"login":"AlbertBCN33","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDE1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/subscriptions","type":"User","ur