ertBCN33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlbertBCN33","id":5541588,"login":"AlbertBCN33","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDE1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlbertBCN33","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlbertBCN33/micro-frontends/commits/844f54f1fca5f13577b47baba5d79a514417c52c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:18:31Z","email":"albert_haf@hotmail.com","name":"AlbertBCN33"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:18:31Z","email":"albert_haf@hotmail.com","name":"AlbertBCN33"},"message":"build: rebuild workspace on Nx 23, Angular 22 and Native Federation\n\nReplace the Nx 20 / Angular 18 webpack Module Federation setup, whose\nAngular generators are deprecated in Nx 23 and removed in v24, with\nNative Federation on the default esbuild application builder.\n\n- Node 24 LTS (.nvmrc); Angular 22.2, TypeScript 6, Nx 23.2\n- apps: shell (dynamic host), market and wishlist (remotes), shell-e2e\n- publishable shared libraries under libs/shared, tagged by type/scope\n- module-boundary rules encode the architecture: remotes never import\n  each other\n- Vitest (inferred @nx/vitest targets), cached typecheck targets\n- Nx Release for independent, conventional-commit versioning of libs\n- drop SSR and Tailwind (see docs/adr/0006)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c53edd2d007be2529d5637f4fb2dab64a32250ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlbertBCN33/micro-frontends/