r\nproduces imports for payloadenvironment.js and getprojectsresponsebodyprojectsaibots.js\nwithout generating those files, causing TypeScript compilation to fail.\n\nPin to 1.765.1 (last known-good version) until Speakeasy ships a fix.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83e606d988aa22c4b954b352984f140fa3459aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/sdk/git/trees/83e606d988aa22c4b954b352984f140fa3459aef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/sdk/git/commits/7d953aadffddfca14119e3269d6651c0c1424c9b","verification":{"payload":"tree 83e606d988aa22c4b954b352984f140fa3459aef\nparent a872816fc3b220f0d9655c9b3e3351cfeecf9998\nauthor Ismael <ismael@vercel.com> 1780527973 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780527973 -0600\n\nfix: pin speakeasy to 1.765.1 to unblock generation (#304)\n\nSpeakeasy latest (post-1.765.1) introduced a regression where the generator\nproduces imports for payloadenvironment.js and getprojectsresponsebodyprojectsaibots.js\nwithout generating those files, causing TypeScript compilation to fail.\n\nPin to 1.765.1 (last known-good version) until Speakeasy ships a fix.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqILNlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+Z4QACZHcmUPjKU9WdtWV9BIHfNp\nr/taA7ud3/YWxjJf9z0V6RSw/rnR2D2stxkrQlCeO75E6ArEvgVAq+kQ9WMHjKAV\nUN1m7Kx0P1gfw62hF+sEVcMiT0IGr3f+0agb57fyevFPLxbZNF4rGu0lMnx5iW9k\nfqUws+QV15S8eNmkdSDDX9vybhXMHMhFAiOA1JANpxW3VWEH+zLUtVPoz7cyxDw0\nn1j/imvUHc7WuH16rRuoJ70RgpEWswoHlJz6O/moMstwh1kbUBqb5ekcVbsOByp0\nYEKbpZ8e9NEvLOyf0qkb/eG5xpCgMEMfTjXx60oclb2KXNTkstJqxa3l5hmm2s8q\nqs4VcKKIMajnV3AwtTsMCKxJ8/5tk8P2TOS4sMHPikL8OW7nDvr+Kny++BNAl9ZF\n/MNQoTHG4Ox6ovy5pElZwoq62XShfYmqrrugNH+M5avMhVo3QKDFoCc6BoFARRsc\n8b8rkcnls3Qr2IKq+Af4RyjZQcaDNVeocZjxT5cBVJHeo2US8Y5CDD2fpcQYS78l\npIlEV2TPU/PyT0udfI7ErmbQc/ATQllL7ZjKcnqeIyJjubHmf3E9R+vwF2P65M6P\nHMKN151L4MYooMqBexYYof3H+kN0HGsBOfxe+8QVw+jEJf5+/uDK