gen.lock)\nafter `SandboxCommand` was removed from the live OpenAPI spec, but left\n`runcommandop.ts`, `funcs/sandboxesRunCommand.ts`, and\n`mcp-server/tools/sandboxesRunCommand.ts` in place because they were\nnot tracked in gen.lock. This broke the TypeScript compile step with\n`TS2307: Cannot find module ''./sandboxcommand.js''`.\n\nManually deleted the three orphaned files and ran `speakeasy run` to\nsync the generated SDK with the live spec, which has fully removed all\nv1 sandbox APIs in favour of the v2 session-based API.\n\nNote: the gen.lock tracking gap (7 op.ts files untracked) should be\nreported to Speakeasy as a generator bug.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f49917f1eaff409059b755fc18e54e18d0bb62f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/sdk/git/trees/6f49917f1eaff409059b755fc18e54e18d0bb62f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/sdk/git/commits/0d677760a61e8817205d05bf238ca9d96fb17d51","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f49917f1eaff409059b755fc18e54e18d0bb62f\nparent cf543d1ae9a5ea8b6369ba2b0a19935d998a6dbb\nauthor Ismael <ismael@vercel.com> 1779733319 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779733319 -0600\n\nfix: unblock SDK generation by removing orphaned v1 sandbox files (#301)\n\nThe Speakeasy generator deleted `sandboxcommand.ts` (tracked in gen.lock)\nafter `SandboxCommand` was removed from the live OpenAPI spec, but left\n`runcommandop.ts`, `funcs/sandboxesRunCommand.ts`, and\n`mcp-server/tools/sandboxesRunCommand.ts` in place because they were\nnot tracked in gen.lock. This broke the TypeScript compile step with\n`TS2307: Cannot find module ''./sandboxcommand.js''`.\n\nManually deleted the three orphaned files and ran `speakeasy run` to\nsync the generated SDK with the live spec, which has fully removed all\nv1 sandbox APIs in favour of the v2 session-based API.\n\nNote: the gen.lock tracking gap (7 op.ts files untracked) should be\nreported to Speakeasy as a generator bug.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cu