hZDRjNDYxMWJkMWFmYjEzMTM4MGFkYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat/eleva/commit/ce6a670c6083d89454d831a3fcf8ee19b5ea0a9d","sha":"ce6a670c6083d89454d831a3fcf8ee19b5ea0a9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/commits/ce6a670c6083d89454d831a3fcf8ee19b5ea0a9d"}],"sha":"833e55bab4381aa4ad4c4611bd1afb131380adc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/commits/833e55bab4381aa4ad4c4611bd1afb131380adc9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3501930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat","id":3501930,"login":"TarekRaafat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDE5MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/commits/ce6a670c6083d89454d831a3fcf8ee19b5ea0a9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T14:16:58Z","email":"tarek.m.raafat@gmail.com","name":"Tarek Raafat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T14:16:58Z","email":"tarek.m.raafat@gmail.com","name":"Tarek Raafat"},"message":"feat!: Eleva.js v1.0.0 - First Stable Release\n\nAfter 14 release candidates and extensive testing, Eleva.js is ready\nfor production use. This release delivers a minimal 2.3KB framework\nwith signal-based reactivity, zero dependencies, and exceptional\ndeveloper experience.\n\nBREAKING CHANGES:\n- Props plugin removed - props now evaluated natively in core\n- {{ }} handlebars syntax removed - use ${} template literals only\n- Simplified mental model: ${} needs ctx., directives don''t\n\nCore Improvements:\n- Native props evaluation - direct value passing without JSON\n- Memory leak fixed - 71-83% reduction in memory overhead\n- Bundle size reduced to ~2.3KB gzipped (from ~2.5KB)\n- Renderer now clears tempContainer after diffing for proper GC\n\nPerformance:\n- 240+ FPS rendering capability\n- Chrome memory: ~0.5KB/row overhead (1K rows)\n- Chrome memory: ~1.37KB/row overhead (10K rows)\n- Zero memory growth on updates, swaps, and clears\n- Accurate benchmark methodology using pure DOM baseline\n\nOfficial Plugins (3):\n- Attr (~2.2KB) - ARIA, data, boolean attributes\n- Router (~3.5KB) - SPA routing with history/hash modes\n- Store (~1.8KB) - Global state management","tree":{"sha":"9204e6a355858cecfc0901c3628ce4a4111eab8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/git/trees/9204e6a355858cecfc0901c3628ce4a4111eab8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/git/commits/ce6a670c6083d89454d831a3fcf8ee19b5ea0a9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3501930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat","id":3501930,"login":"TarekRaafat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDE5MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/receive