ing Breaking Changes\" to target future release instead\n  of specific version (rc.13)","tree":{"sha":"c73a849d8f1f3ad8b65f8611685a06a18fe522e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/git/trees/c73a849d8f1f3ad8b65f8611685a06a18fe522e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/git/commits/d4efc5422ffb93ad4b8982527dee0a0e7b6fd2bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3501930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat","id":3501930,"login":"TarekRaafat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDE5MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat/eleva/commit/d4efc5422ffb93ad4b8982527dee0a0e7b6fd2bc","node_id":"C_kwDONUAOz9oAKGQ0ZWZjNTQyMmZmYjkzYWQ0Yjg5ODI1MjdkZWUwYTBlN2I2ZmQyYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat/eleva/commit/16a0f41bfbe1f37dc3bcb82d84c0b22f1f28818a","sha":"16a0f41bfbe1f37dc3bcb82d84c0b22f1f28818a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/commits/16a0f41bfbe1f37dc3bcb82d84c0b22f1f28818a"}],"sha":"d4efc5422ffb93ad4b8982527dee0a0e7b6fd2bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/commits/d4efc5422ffb93ad4b8982527dee0a0e7b6fd2bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3501930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat","id":3501930,"login":"TarekRaafat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDE5MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/commits/16a0f41bfbe1f37dc3bcb82d84c0b22f1f28818a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-09T18:14:23Z","email":"tarek.m.raafat@gmail.com","name":"Tarek Raafat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-09T18:14:23Z","email":"tarek.m.raafat@gmail.com","name":"Tarek Raafat"},"message":"fix(core): restore form element property sync and revert rc.12 breaking changes\n\nThis release addresses critical issues discovered in rc.12:\n\n- Fix form element property sync bug where input values weren''t clearing\n  after user interaction (e.g., todo app input field staying populated\n  after submit even when signal was set to \"\")\n\n- Revert render scheduling to rc.11 behavior (reset flag before render)\n  to ensure signal changes during render trigger follow-up renders.\n  User control > framework protection for circular dependencies.\n\n- Revert TemplateEngine error handling to return \"\" instead of undefined\n  to prevent literal \"undefined\" text appearing in templates\n\nChanges:\n- Add SYNC_PROPS constant for form element property sync (value, checked, selected)\n- Add explicit property synchronization loop in _updateAttributes()\n- Reset renderScheduled flag before render (rc.11 behavior)\n- Return \"\" on evaluation errors in TemplateEngine (rc.11 behavior)\n- Retain function caching optimization from rc.12\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: If you updated code in rc.12 to check === undefined\nfor TemplateEngine errors, revert to checking === \"\"","tree":{"sha":"fb236c4e9715f7734e24259988542b276c33a11f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/git/trees/fb236c4e9715f7734e24259988542b276c33a11f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TarekRaafat/eleva/git/commits/16a0f41bfbe1f37dc3bcb82d84c0b22f1f28818a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3501930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat","id":3501930,"login":"TarekRaafat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDE5MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TarekRaafat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TarekRaafat/eleva/commit/16a0f41bfbe1f37dc3bcb82d84c0b22