blic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-lca/commits/190f3a685191b64e538bd5120b0809e533752e56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-14T05:16:52Z","email":"78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Louis Trümpler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-14T05:16:52Z","email":"78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Louis Trümpler"},"message":"Refactor LCA Calculator and Improve Material Handling\n\n- Streamlined material aggregation logic in the WebSocket server, enhancing the extraction and processing of materials from project elements.\n- Simplified the handling of materials by removing unnecessary checks and consolidating logic for better readability and performance.\n- Updated emission calculation to utilize a new structure for element emissions, improving accuracy and efficiency.\n- Removed the UnmodelledMaterialForm component to simplify the user interface and focus on modelled materials.\n- Enhanced the ReviewDialog to display calculated impacts more effectively and updated the data structure for better integration with the LCA calculator.\n- Improved logging and error handling throughout the LCA calculation process for better debugging and maintenance.","tree":{"sha":"6313328524e85a3bfbb6bb89c96d7c40dcf5631d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-lca/git/trees/6313328524e85a3bfbb6bb89c96d7c40dcf5631d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-lca/git/commits/190f3a685191b64e538bd5120b0809e533752e56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78563314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/