/louistrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-lca/commits/4e8264b91fef65a6dcea23955425bb337a47a557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-12T11:21:09Z","email":"78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Louis Trümpler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-12T11:21:09Z","email":"78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Louis Trümpler"},"message":"Refactor KafkaService and Update WebSocket Server\n\n- Removed the qto-materials.db file as it is no longer needed.\n- Refactored KafkaService to enhance data handling, including the introduction of KafkaMetadata and LcaData interfaces.\n- Updated sendLcaBatchToKafka method to handle material instances and calculate relative impacts.\n- Improved WebSocket server to manage project metadata and handle incoming messages more effectively.\n- Streamlined CORS configuration and ensured proper handling of project materials and emissions.\n- Enhanced error handling and logging for better debugging and maintenance.","tree":{"sha":"57482a33c8c560ff8791fa6ceeea197b728a12c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-lca/git/trees/57482a33c8c560ff8791fa6ceeea197b728a12c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-lca/git/commits/4e8264b91fef65a6dcea23955425bb337a47a557","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78563314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id