","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"fix: resolve dependabot alerts for axios, fast-uri, fast-xml-parser, shell-quote\n\n- Updated `fast-xml-parser` override to `^5.10.1` to fix DOCTYPE parsing entity expansion vulnerability.\n- Updated `fast-uri` override to `3.1.4` to fix host confusion vulnerabilities.\n- Added `shell-quote` override to `^1.9.0` to fix Quadratic-complexity DoS vulnerability.\n- Added `axios` override to `1.18.1` to fix multiple prototype pollution, proxy, and SSRF/DoS vulnerabilities in transitives.\n- Ran tests and verified compatibility.\n\nCo-authored-by: govinda777 <498332+govinda777@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebc92e6c822c7d6ab7e13bcd51b9df82c89addb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/Xperience/git/trees/ebc92e6c822c7d6ab7e13bcd51b9df82c89addb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/Xperience/git/commits/197eef1c73141d811e685bd10afcd1281242fd3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use