ic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/Xperience/commits/d58e31db5e386f4ae99ab51bbaffc8f9d7419226/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T00:15:07Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T00:15:07Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"Fix Vercel function limits and address PR feedback\n\n- Changes api/_routes handlers to use named exports (export const handler) to avoid being detected as standalone Vercel functions, solving the Hobby plan limit error.\n- Centralizes routing via `api/index.ts` rewriting to use those named exports.\n- Updates `.vercelignore` to properly exclude backend directories from deploying as separate Lambdas.\n- Replaces InMemoryWalletRepository with PrismaWalletRepository to correctly persist user wallets in Postgres, addressing PR feedback on its in-memory limitations.\n\nCo-authored-by: govinda777 <498332+govinda777@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"212ede8642f87270b4e106593fdc1a4f364eeab2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/Xperience/git/trees/212ede8642f87270b4e106593fdc1a4f364eeab2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/Xperience/git/commits/d58e31db5e386f4ae99ab51bbaffc8f9d7419226","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":16136