"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/Xperience/commits/f327f09a7e3e8c8ba6112188d8b859e42be4954e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T17:22:30Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T17:22:30Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"Fix Vercel serverless function limits by using a centralized router\n\n- Removes `export default` from all internal route handlers in `api/_routes` and replaces them with named exports (`export const handler`).\n- Updates `api/index.ts` to import the named exports correctly.\n- Adds `.vercelignore` entries for backend internal directories (`api/_routes/**`, `api/_lib/**`, `api/agent/**`, `api/lib/**`, `api/prisma/**`) to prevent Vercel from deploying each internal file as an independent serverless function, which was causing the \"No more than 12 Serverless Functions\" error on the Hobby plan.\n- Updates unit tests to import the named exports correctly.\n\nCo-authored-by: govinda777 <498332+govinda777@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bcf2722626095b82be92e1b3be282a17a3a16c50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/Xperience/git/trees/bcf2722626095b82be92e1b3be282a17a3a16c50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govinda777/Xperience/git/commits/f327f09a7e3e8c8ba6112188d8b859e42be4954e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.