e5a91e6885"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/importContentFromJson/commit/7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841","sha":"7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841"}],"sha":"27c48337569bab8d6b760596032ea5be1a1117d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/27c48337569bab8d6b760596032ea5be1a1117d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/58157e08ddc0fe8c570ff34c254e3d44f30eea97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:58:21Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:58:21Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Bump build-time deps and pin patched transitives (Dependabot, dev-only)\n\nThese are build-toolchain dependencies only — none ship in the OSGi bundle.\nVerified: `yarn build:production` compiles successfully and 38 Jest tests pass.\n\n- Bump webpack ^5.91.0 -> ^5.97.1 (resolves to 5.108.4), clearing the\n  webpack advisories with published fixes.\n- Add Yarn resolutions forcing patched transitive versions:\n    braces ^3.0.3        (GHSA-grv7-fg5c-xmjg, high)\n    micromatch ^4.0.8    (GHSA-952p-6rrq-rcjv)\n    postcss ^8.5.10      (GHSA-7fh5-64p2-3v2j, GHSA-qx2v-qp2m-jg93)\n    node-fetch ^2.7.0    (GHSA-r683-j2x4-v87g, high)\n    @babel/runtime ^7.26.10 (GHSA-968p-4wvh-cqc8)\n  The micromatch and node-fetch resolutions pull a couple of older-major\n  transitive consumers up; validated by a clean production build + tests.\n\nNot addressed (intentionally):\n- @cyclonedx/webpack-plugin stays at ^3.8.2. v5 requires Node >=20 but the\n  build is pinned to Node 18 (POM frontend-maven-plugin), and libxmljs2\n  (the critical alert) is an OPTIONAL dependency in every cyclonedx-library\n  version, used only for XML SBOM validation. We emit JSON SBOM, the native\n  module already fails to build (and is skipped), so it never runs. Not\n  cleanly removable without replacing the SBOM plugin + bumping Node.\n- Several alerts (lodash, tar, qs, js-yaml, serialize-javascript, flatted,\n  immutable, fast-uri, picomatch) have advisory ranges above the latest\n  published version, i.e. no fixed release exists yet to bump to.","tree":{"sha":"84b7393fb245d42c0ba2a18937a627c18be22ffd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/git/trees/84b7393fb245d42c0ba2a18937a627c18be22ffd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/git/commits/58157e08ddc0fe8c570ff34c254e3d44f30eea97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/importContentFromJson/commit/58157e08ddc0fe8c570ff34c254e3d44f30eea97","node_id":"C_kwDONWJwZ9oAKDU4MTU3ZTA4ZGRjMGZlOGM1NzBmZjM0YzI1NGUzZDQ0ZjMwZWVhOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/importContentFromJson/commit/7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841","sha":"7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841"}],"sha":"58157e08ddc0fe8c570ff34c254e3d44f30eea97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/58157e08ddc0fe8c570ff34c254e3d44f30eea97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:53:09Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:53:09Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Remove dead polyfill deps and bump commons-io (Dependabot)\n\nFixes the vulnerabilities that actually reach the deployed artifact:\n\n- Bump commons-io 2.11.0 -> 2.18.0 (GHSA-78wr-2p64-hpwj, high). This jar\n  is bundled into the OSGi module at runtime. Servlets recompiled and\n  verified against 2.18.0 (IOUtils API unchanged).\n\n- Remove node-polyfill-webpack-plugin (devDep) and the unused buffer,\n  stream-browserify and util runtime deps. None are referenced in the\n  source or the webpack config (no ProvidePlugin/fallback polyfills), so\n  they never shipped. Removing them prunes the crypto-browserify subtree\n  from the lockfile, eliminating pbkdf2 (2x critical), sha.js (critical),\n  elliptic and the rest of that chain.\n\nVerified: production webpack build compiles successfully without the\nremoved deps; 38 Jest tests pass.\n\nThe remaining Dependabot alerts (webpack, babel, jest, rollup, tar, sass,\nnode-fetch, qs, postcss, libxmljs2 via the CycloneDX SBOM plugin, etc.)\nare build-time-only dependencies that are not part of the shipped bundle;\nthey are tracked separately from this runtime-security work.","tree":{"sha":"4be99ee74b2c699b06bb2f4966b4389cc6996d47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/git/trees/4be99ee74b2c699b06bb2f4966b4389cc6996d47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/git/commits/7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/importContentFromJson/commit/7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841","node_id":"C_kwDONWJwZ9oAKDczNDNlNDc5MTEzZTU4ZWJjZjJhZDhiNGQ5OTc4M2ExOGJmN2I4NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/importContentFromJson/commit/0b5482627ee12e715ff36d5f12e71fea405b352e","sha":"0b5482627ee12e715ff36d5f12e71fea405b352e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/0b5482627ee12e715ff36d5f12e71fea405b352e"}],"sha":"7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/7343e479113e58ebcf2ad8b4d99783a18bf7b841"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/commits/0b5482627ee12e715ff36d5f12e71fea405b352e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:47:08Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T14:47:08Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Security hardening, correctness fixes, and import-engine refactor\n\nSecurity (critical):\n- Remove hardcoded Unsplash access key from the shipped .cfg; document\n  setting it at deploy time. NOTE: the leaked key must be rotated (it\n  remains in git history).\n- ImageProxyServlet: close the open SSRF. Require an authenticated\n  non-guest session; allow only http/https; reject loopback, link-local,\n  site-local, any-local and multicast targets; optional allowedHosts\n  allow-list; do not follow redirects; add connect/read timeouts.\n- LocalFileProxyServlet: close arbitrary file read. Require auth; confine\n  reads to configured localFileProxy.allowedRoots (fail closed when unset);\n  stop echoing absolute server paths in error responses.\n\nCorrectness:\n- Publish after import (new opt-in checkbox, i18n in en/fr/de/es): publish\n  created/updated nodes with publishSubNodes so referenced images go live.\n- Fix totalAttempts used before assignment in the failure-path summary.\n- De-duplicate colliding node names within a run (-2/-3 suffix) instead of\n  silently overwriting/skipping.\n- Build vanity URLs from the sanitized path, not the raw input.\n- Coerce handleMultipleValues null to [] before sending to GraphQL.\n- Guard flattenCategoryTree against missing children.nodes.\n- Guard window.* host APIs (contextJsParameters, CE_API, jahiaGWTParameters,\n  jahia.*) with optional chaining.\n- Make AddTags/AddCategories explicitly target workspace: EDIT.\n\nRefactor:\n- Extract the ~540-line import loop into a pure, dependency-injected\n  ImportEngine.runImport() returning structured results; the component''s\n  startImport is now a thin adapter (component 1245 -> 735 lines).\n- Cap concurrent image/file uploads via processConcurrent instead of an\n  unbounded Promise.all.\n- Remove dead code and unused imports.\n\nTests / tooling:\n- Make the Jest suite runnable: add babel.config.js (test-env only),\n  jest.setup.js (TextEncoder polyfill), style + ''~'' alias mappers, and the\n  jest-environment-jsdom devDependency.\n- Add 16 ImportEngine unit tests (guards, create/update/skip, name dedup,\n  publish, vanity URL, tags, categories). 38 tests pass.\n\nDocs:\n- README: correct the security section and document the new .cfg keys.","tree":{"sha":"37e682e5c1ccf7dd63e459c215cdaa74068b7681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/git/trees/37e682e5c1ccf7dd63e459c215cdaa74068b7681"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/importContentFromJson/git/commits/0b5482627ee12e715ff36d5f12e71fea405b352e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht